GATE="shellcheck"
EXPECT_EXIT="2"
DESCRIPTION="THE WORST ONE. An unreadable subdirectory makes the file enumeration fail partway. The producer ran in a process-substitution subshell whose non-zero status the parent discarded, so the gate carried on over a truncated file list and reported PASS -- printing 'the gate did not complete' twice on its way to exit 0. The same shape in the secret scanner silently dropped detected secrets. Must now be exit 2: an incomplete scan is not a clean one."
